    </sectiondef>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Class which can be overriden by targets to enforce instruction dependencies and behaviours that aren&apos;t expressed well enough within the scheduling model for mca to automatically simulate them properly. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>If you implement this class for your target, make sure to also implement a target specific <ref refid="classllvm_1_1mca_1_1_instr_post_process" kindref="compound">InstrPostProcess</ref> class as well. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
